tory":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the Adair County record runs 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids November to December came in under 90% of normal in 39 of those 75 years. In 2025 the middle of the grids ran 182% of normal in April to May and just 33% in November to December. Every grid had its driest year in 1963, and grids 18743 and 19342 got down to 50% that year.</p>"}
